items.title:
build.jenesis:build.jenesis.repository.proxy 0.0.1 发布, The dispatcher discovers it with {@code ServiceLoader} and names no transport;
a deployment without this module serves local content only (a proxy upstream is never consulted, an import is
refused). Depends only on the format SPI and {@code java.net.http}.

